      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1902-11-28_WidnesExaminer_art0033" n="art0033">
        <head>'HAD TO BE LIFTED UP IN BED'. -- A Yarn Scourer's Terrible Conciition.</head>
        <p>'HAD TO BE LIFTED UP IN BED'. -- A Yarn Scourer's Terrible Conciition.</p>
        <p>Bile Beans Effect a Complete Cure Weakness and Lumbago Ended.</p>
        <p>ill local sufferers from backache, side pains, head— ache, and that " run down " feeling, are likely to reap much benefit from the experience of Mrs John Thomas Ackroyd. of Dyeon-fitreet, Haugh Shaw-road, Halifax, who was completely cured of those ailments by Chas. Ferde'e Bile Beane for Biliousness. Mr Ackroyd was formerly a prominent member of the Stanuary White Star Football Club, but he got so weak and ill that playing became impossible. To a " Halifax Guardian" reporter, he said : "I began to euff 3r from debility, and I became alto— gether run down, At times I was racked with pais is my back, head, and side. You may guess what I had come to w hen I tell you that my wife had to lift me tip in bed, and that I could not put on my own olethes ! Of courte, I could not do any work, my appetite left me, and I always felt weary and fagged. At the same time, although I felt like that I could set sleep. reople used to say to me, • Whatever's</p>
        <p>up ? Tha /ocks like a dead 'tin.' I Wil bothered with pimples, too, and had a large boil on my arm. The doctor said I had lumbago, and was completely run down. He gave me quinine, but it did me no good. We got a little book one day, tolling about Chas.Forde's Bile Beans for Biliousness, and I sent my wife for a box. I went on taking them straight away, and before I had taken the first box I was worlds better, My back,which had given way with the heavy lifting, got stronger ; and I began 0 feel better all round. Then I got baok my appetite, and began to enjoy and to digest my food. Bit by bit I improved, until I bad no need to take any more medicine. I did not leave the Beans off all at once, however,but gradually reduced the doses; and now I have no need to take either Bile Beans or any other form ot medicine. I am in grand condition, better than I ever before remember having felt. As a matter of fact, I am quickly putting on flesh. There is no doubt about it, say cure was brought about entirely through Charles ',circle's Bile Beans ; and I shall always recommend them. Chas Forde's Bile Beans for Biliousness are unequalled her indigeetion,liver and kidney disorders,constipation, headache,general debility, nervousness, anrernia, female ailments, palpitation dizzi- nese, pains in the chest, aide and back, fulness and nausea after meals aid that " tired feeling." They are also unrivalled for colds chill, rhedmatism and as a preventive of influenza. Al, ' chemists stock them, or you may obtain direct from that Bile Bean Manufacturing Ca., Red Cross-street, London, E.G., by sending prices is lid or 25 9d (25 9d, box con- tains three times la lid). Bile leans are sold only in , boxes and not loose.</p>
